SAGA-16 uses the canonical `GtocTerminal` vocabulary only. `OperatorNeeded` is a survivor route, not a terminal. An absent canonical owner terminalizes as `OpenObstruction` with survivor route `OperatorNeeded` until a separate packet admits the needed operator, owner, or license.


